- Limits: title 120, message 8192, --field 12 (key 40, value 200), --link 4, --file 10, -c 2 to 12 (label 40).
- Check first: --dry-run has the API validate it and sends nothing; kabu whoami shows the key, project and agent.
- Yes or no: kabu ask "Deploy?" exits 0 only when approved (10 rejected); --type confirm -c Ship -c Wait names the buttons.
